<title>USA: Gaylord Container Corp Q4 Sept 30 loss.</title>
<headline>Gaylord Container Corp Q4 Sept 30 loss.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.17   profit	 $1.00</p>
<p> Net loss		   9,200   profit	55,100</p>
<p> Revs		     223,400		  268,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,600		   55,200</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes loss of $600,000 or $0.01/shr for early retirement of debt. 1996 Q4, year includes pre-tax charge for costs related to staff reductions of $8.1 million and costs of $5.4 million for early retirement program.  </p>
<p>			    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.16   profit	 $2.44</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,600   profit     134,200</p>
<p> Revs		     922,000		1,051,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  54,700		   55,100</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 full-year results include loss of $3.2 million or $0.06/shr for early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>1995 full-year results include a $5.4 million ($5.3 million after tax) charge against operating earnings for costs associated with an optional early retirement program at the company's California mill and a non-recurring $27.2 million income tax benefit.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
